      "body": "I re-checked this against main, and the issues addressed by this PR are still present.\n\nVLLM_WSL2_ENABLE_PIN_MEMORY still defaults to False, and the kernel version check remains separate. The troubleshooting documentation also still has no WSL2 section.\n\nTwo upstream changes could be included: the warning for combining CPU offload with CUDA graphs on WSL2, and the note about the circular import caused by warning_once on WSL.\n\nI can include both if useful.\n\nStill docs-only and mergeable.\n",
